{
  "uid": "go-streams-overview",
  "title": "[go-streams] Fleet Overview",
  "description": "Four Golden Signals overview for all go-streams applications. Start here; drill down per application, topology node, or partition via the linked dashboards.",
  "tags": [
    "go-streams",
    "kafka",
    "golden-signals",
    "owner:go-streams"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m",
      "30m",
      "1h"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Data source",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": ""
      },
      {
        "name": "job",
        "label": "Application (job)",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(messaging_consumer_messages_total, job)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(messaging_consumer_messages_total, job)",
          "refId": "var-job"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": {},
        "options": [],
        "regex": "",
        "hide": 0,
        "allValue": ".+"
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "asDropdown": true,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "tags": [
        "go-streams"
      ],
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "go-streams dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## go-streams \u00b7 Fleet Overview\n**Question this dashboard answers:** *Is any go-streams application in trouble right now \u2014 and which one?*\n\nOrganised by the **Four Golden Signals** (Traffic, Errors, Latency, Saturation). Every graph is split by `job` only \u2014 once you know *which* application is unhealthy, drill down via the **go-streams dashboards** link (top right); your `job` selection and time range carry over.\n\n**Drill-down path:** Fleet Overview \u2192 *Application Drill-Down* (per topic) \u2192 *Topology Explorer* (per node/edge) \u2192 *Runner & Saturation* (per partition / backpressure).\n\nThresholds mirror the alerting examples in the go-streams observability docs (error ratio > 1 %, lag p99 > 30 s, queue depth > 1000, > 5 rebalances / 10 min). Refresh is 1 m to match the default OTel periodic export interval \u2014 faster refresh adds backend load without new data. Replace the `owner:go-streams` tag with your own team's tag."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "At a glance",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Consume rate",
      "description": "Total records consumed per second across selected jobs (messaging.consumer.messages).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(messaging_consumer_messages_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "mps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Produce rate",
      "description": "Total records produced to sink topics per second (messaging.producer.messages).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(messaging_producer_messages_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "mps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error ratio",
      "description": "Errors as a fraction of consumed records over the rate interval. Docs suggest alerting above 1 %.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(stream_errors_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(messaging_consumer_messages_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.001
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.01
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Consumer lag p99",
      "description": "99th percentile of time-since-produced for consumed records (stream.consumer.lag). Docs suggest alerting above 30 s.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(stream_consumer_lag_bucket{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 30
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Records not succeeding",
      "description": "Rate of records whose final outcome was dropped, sent to DLQ, or failed (stream.process.duration count by status).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(stream_process_duration_seconds_count{job=~\"$job\", stream_process_status=~\"dropped|dlq|failed\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "mps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Rebalances (range)",
      "description": "Rebalance events (assigned + revoked) over the selected time range. Frequent rebalances indicate group instability; docs suggest alerting on > 5 in 10 min.",
